  "historyNote": "#8479, eff 11-30-05 (see Revision Note at part heading for Env-Dw 1001) (formerly Env-Ws 393.12); ss by #10616, eff 6-1-14 (from Env-Dw 1001.10); ss by #14121, eff 11-23-24, EXPIRES: 11-23-34",
